<section class="image-fan-section library-section">
  <h2>[ Image Fan - Component ]</h2>

  <p>
    Images curve along an arc whose radius is derived from the spread and the
    card spacing, so the whole fan scales with its parent container. Comes with
    the following configs:
  </p>
  <ul class="classic-list">
    <li>
      <code>images</code> an array of images, each taking <code>src</code> and
      <code>alt</code>. Any number of entries.
    </li>
    <li>
      <code>arc</code> a number, the degrees the fan wraps — <code>0</code> =
      flat row, <code>90</code> = quarter circle, <code>180</code> = semicircle,
      <code>360</code> = full ring. Defaults to <code>90</code>
    </li>
    <li>
      <code>gap</code> a number, the spacing between cards as a multiple of card
      width (<code>1</code> = touching, above <code>1</code> = gap, below
      <code>1</code> = overlap). Defaults to <code>1.15</code>
    </li>
    <li>
      <code>chop</code> a number, the pixels each ring drops below the one
      inside it, outward from the centre — <code>12</code> drops the 2nd / 4th
      cards <code>12</code>px, the 1st / 5th <code>24</code>px, and so on for a
      stepped-down fan. Defaults to <code>0</code>
    </li>
    <li>
      <code>closed</code> a boolean, spread the images evenly around a full
      <code>360</code> ring (ignores <code>arc</code>). Defaults to
      <code>false</code>
    </li>
    <li>
      <code>direction</code> a string, <code>up</code> (rainbow, middle card
      highest) or <code>down</code> (valley). Defaults to <code>up</code>
    </li>
    <li>
      <code>stack</code> a string, <code>sequence</code> (stack in array order)
      or <code>pyramid</code> (centre card on top, stepping down symmetrically
      to the first and last). Defaults to <code>sequence</code>
    </li>
    <li>
      <code>item_width</code> a number, the card width as a percent of the
      component's own width (<code>22</code> = 22%). Defaults to
      <code>22</code>
    </li>
    <li>
      <code>animate_in</code> a boolean, reveal the fan when it scrolls into
      view (wires up the <code>gsap-animate</code> util) —
      <code>sequence</code> rises the cards in with a staggered fade,
      <code>pyramid</code> starts them collapsed on the centre card then opens
      the fan out along the arc. Defaults to <code>false</code>
    </li>
    <li><code>class</code> a string value for a custom css class</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Hover feel — sibling shift, rotation, ripple delay and easing — plus the
    <code>animate_in</code> offset, rise, duration and stagger are tuned with
    the <code>--fan-*</code> custom properties at the top of
    <code>.image-fan</code> in <code>_image-fan.scss</code>.
  </p>

  <br />
  <br />

  <!-- prettier-ignore -->
  {% set image_fan = library.image_fan %}
  {% include "../_includes/components/image-fan.njk" %}
</section>

